== 5. what this run does and does not establish ==
   Establishes: the leg executes end to end, 78 declared bins over 13 distinct read HIT, and the checker's
   keyed output matches an independent reading of the same report bin for bin.
   Does not establish: that a declared-but-unhit bin fails a run. No entry declared a bin it missed, so the
   failing direction of this leg is still unexercised in the retained record.
